Hi, Upwork community,

We are a cozy web development outsourcing agency based in Lviv, Ukraine. We work with small/mid-sized startups in Healthcare and Fintech domains. Our team size is up to 20. Most projects are custom JavaScript Development(React.js, React Native, and Node.js) and WordPress.

That's a part-time role with the ability to scale to full-time on-demand. 

